WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.920
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.000 --> 01:35.080
And the sentence?

01:35.160 --> 01:36.000
Strangling.

01:36.080 --> 01:38.240
Steal something valuable
or serious enough,

01:38.320 --> 01:39.160
and your clan

01:39.240 --> 01:40.320
gets dragged in.

01:42.120 --> 01:44.200
- How many clans?
- At least three.

01:44.280 --> 01:46.560
If it's worse, nine.

01:49.600 --> 01:50.840
Are these seeds valuable?

01:51.920 --> 01:52.760
Priceless.

01:54.520 --> 01:56.200
- Then sentence him at once.
- Understood.

01:57.800 --> 01:59.160
Please have mercy, Your Ladyship.

02:00.000 --> 02:01.280
Even if I must die,

02:01.800 --> 02:03.960
can I at least take the ginseng seeds home

02:04.880 --> 02:06.280
to save my son?

02:09.800 --> 02:10.639
Explain.

02:16.280 --> 02:17.440
My young boy

02:19.160 --> 02:20.720
has always been frail

02:21.480 --> 02:22.880
and takes medicine all year round.

02:22.960 --> 02:25.920
A few months ago,
he developed another strange disease

02:26.640 --> 02:28.120
and was aching to the bones.

02:28.200 --> 02:29.960
But in the vast Western Capital,

02:30.040 --> 02:32.040
nobody was able to cure him.

02:32.120 --> 02:34.880
One day, a traveling physician

02:34.960 --> 02:36.440
said he had a folk remedy for it.

02:36.520 --> 02:39.920
But the prescription
contains an essential ingredient,

02:40.960 --> 02:42.120
the ginseng seeds.

02:43.080 --> 02:45.160
Those are exclusively for the royal family

02:45.240 --> 02:46.880
and hard to obtain for commoners.

02:46.960 --> 02:48.680
I tried everything

02:48.760 --> 02:51.160
and spent a fortune on the black market,
only to get two pieces.

02:55.160 --> 02:56.760
Fortunately, the prescription worked.

02:56.840 --> 02:59.880
My son took the medicine and slept soundly

02:59.960 --> 03:01.960
without crying at all.

03:03.160 --> 03:04.800
But he wasn't cured.

03:04.880 --> 03:06.240
So we couldn't stop the medicine.

03:06.320 --> 03:09.480
Once we stopped it,
he ached all over again.

03:13.400 --> 03:15.240
It's alright.

03:17.440 --> 03:20.800
We needed
two ginseng seeds every seven days.

03:21.320 --> 03:24.840
They are expensive and hard to obtain,
even with a fortune.

03:24.920 --> 03:26.560
Even those who are well-connected
in the black market

03:26.640 --> 03:28.400
can't get so many of those.

03:31.080 --> 03:34.480
Even if it's to save your son,
you can't steal from the palace.

03:34.560 --> 03:36.320
I-I didn't steal anything.

03:36.400 --> 03:39.000
H-How would I even have
the chance to steal those?

03:39.800 --> 03:41.000
The…

03:43.000 --> 03:44.600
The deity gave them to me.

03:45.240 --> 03:46.080
Deity?

03:52.400 --> 03:53.400
Your Ladyship.

03:54.560 --> 03:56.440
Do you believe in deities?

04:00.880 --> 04:03.200
WORSHIPPING A FALSE DEITY

04:04.080 --> 04:06.840
I watched my son
suffer from illness every day

04:07.840 --> 04:09.480
and my wife grow skinnier.

04:11.440 --> 04:14.160
I could do nothing
but drown my sorrows in liquor,

04:15.320 --> 04:16.360
right up until the night

04:16.959 --> 04:18.240
I was on duty in the palace.

04:18.320 --> 04:21.320
I got drunk and had a dream.

04:55.080 --> 04:56.320
Later, I realized

04:57.200 --> 04:58.680
that it wasn't a dream.

04:59.560 --> 05:01.160
White Asura is back for real.

05:01.880 --> 05:03.400
My son could be saved.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.760
What utter nonsense.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.400
How dare you lie to Her Ladyship?

05:09.480 --> 05:11.280
Are you asking for a beating?

05:21.600 --> 05:24.360
You said that White Asura is back.

05:27.080 --> 05:27.920
Yes.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.880
They showed up and left?

05:31.800 --> 05:32.680
That's right.

05:33.560 --> 05:34.520
I lack the fortune

05:34.600 --> 05:37.160
to have followed them
from the very beginning.

05:39.880 --> 05:42.600
I don't know when he showed up.

05:43.200 --> 05:45.800
But I know
that they vanished two years ago.

05:49.680 --> 05:50.760
That's right.

05:50.840 --> 05:52.000
Two or three years ago,

05:52.080 --> 05:54.000
whispers spread through the palace

05:54.600 --> 05:57.160
that White Asura averted disasters
and cured illnesses.

05:57.240 --> 05:59.960
But those rumors circulated
only among the eunuchs and palace maids.

06:00.560 --> 06:02.600
The palace handles
such matters with great caution.

06:02.680 --> 06:04.800
Inspector Du was worried about witchcraft

06:04.880 --> 06:06.480
or gathering people to plot something
and looked into it,

06:06.560 --> 06:09.280
only to find that the so-called believers

06:09.360 --> 06:11.880
mostly received some favor
purely by chance.

06:11.960 --> 06:13.520
There was nothing shady.

06:13.600 --> 06:15.840
Nor had there been any trouble.

06:15.920 --> 06:18.600
So he told us to keep an eye on it
just in case trouble arises.

06:19.680 --> 06:21.920
What you said rings a bell.

06:22.000 --> 06:24.840
There are often rumors in the palace

06:25.440 --> 06:26.280
about deities and spirits.

06:26.360 --> 06:27.920
In the end, they all went away,

06:28.000 --> 06:30.000
soon replaced by new rumors.

06:30.680 --> 06:32.520
Only half a year later,

06:32.600 --> 06:34.480
no one spoke of White Asura again.

06:34.560 --> 06:35.960
White Asura is real.

06:36.480 --> 06:38.920
White Asura is real.

06:39.000 --> 06:40.800
As long as you are devoted,

06:40.880 --> 06:43.000
they will grant you w-whatever you want.

06:43.600 --> 06:46.440
How do you know
they're the one who helped you?

06:47.720 --> 06:49.680
They manifested in my dreams

06:50.600 --> 06:52.040
and told me I'd get

06:52.840 --> 06:54.040
what I wanted

06:55.080 --> 06:56.360
in a few days.

06:58.160 --> 07:00.720
Two ginseng seeds lasted for seven days.

07:01.240 --> 07:02.120
What happened next?

07:04.520 --> 07:07.120
Did White Asura tell you
to dig Brilliant Lady Dou's magnolia

07:07.200 --> 07:08.480
by the Penglai Pool?

07:12.560 --> 07:14.040
The medicine was ending.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.480
I grew anxious.

07:18.560 --> 07:20.920
I didn't know if White Asura
would appear again.

07:21.680 --> 07:23.360
Thankfully, they were compassionate.

07:23.880 --> 07:24.920
That night,

07:25.600 --> 07:28.040
they manifested in my dream again.

07:28.120 --> 07:31.640
They told me to wait
at the Penglai Pool the next day.

07:32.240 --> 07:34.440
Then, I would be guided

07:34.520 --> 07:35.520
to the ginseng seeds.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.720
I went to the Penglai Pool the next day

07:38.320 --> 07:39.840
and went around it.

07:41.640 --> 07:43.240
I was quite flustered,

07:43.760 --> 07:46.880
wondering how they would
give me instructions in broad daylight.

07:48.160 --> 07:49.480
Then I heard the call

07:49.560 --> 07:51.240
of a most unusual bird.

07:51.840 --> 07:54.560
I looked up and instantly spotted

07:55.080 --> 07:57.640
that beautiful and dazzling white parrot.

07:57.720 --> 07:58.560
I knew

07:58.640 --> 08:00.880
that must be the instruction
given by White Asura.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.520
But people

08:03.600 --> 08:05.520
were coming and going during the day.

08:06.080 --> 08:07.040
I dared not act rashly.

08:08.080 --> 08:09.760
I memorized the location of the parrot

08:10.800 --> 08:13.920
and went back at night,
when no one was around.

08:25.200 --> 08:26.920
White Asura didn't deceive me.

08:27.960 --> 08:29.720
I found the ginseng seeds.

08:32.240 --> 08:35.559
But I also destroyed
Brilliant Lady Dou's magnolia.

08:36.280 --> 08:40.480
I was planning to lie low for a while.

08:41.440 --> 08:44.000
But my son desperately
needed the medicine.

08:44.600 --> 08:46.640
Besides, although Brilliant Lady Dou

08:46.720 --> 08:48.440
and Your Ladyship
started the investigation,

08:48.520 --> 08:50.800
White Asura had left me
more ginseng seeds.

08:51.600 --> 08:55.040
I knew it was risky, but I had no choice.

08:55.800 --> 08:58.240
I had to save my son.

09:00.160 --> 09:02.760
As long as you sincerely
believe in White Asura,

09:03.600 --> 09:05.960
you'll get whatever you want.

09:06.640 --> 09:08.440
It's only been us failing them.

09:08.520 --> 09:10.200
But they have always

09:10.280 --> 09:13.800
been blessing the poor and pitiful.

09:15.000 --> 09:15.960
This time,

09:17.040 --> 09:19.040
I certainly won't let them go.

09:22.080 --> 09:23.760
How are you going to keep them here?

09:29.640 --> 09:30.720
With piety.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.960
That person in white was White Asura?

09:36.040 --> 09:37.160
Yes.

09:37.240 --> 09:39.920
Was it a man or a woman,
and what did they look like?

09:40.600 --> 09:42.680
Deities exist beyond
mortal concepts of gender.

09:42.760 --> 09:45.960
How could we mortals
perceive their true form?

09:46.560 --> 09:48.560
Were you in the palace each time

09:49.280 --> 09:50.440
White Asura manifested?

09:51.160 --> 09:52.000
That's right.

09:53.720 --> 09:54.840
Don't you find it strange?

09:56.280 --> 09:57.160
What…

09:58.320 --> 09:59.160
What about it?

09:59.960 --> 10:01.160
They kept helping you

10:01.680 --> 10:02.840
without asking anything in return?

10:05.320 --> 10:08.800
They simply asked for my piety.

10:11.400 --> 10:12.600
What kind of piety?

10:13.120 --> 10:14.120
How much money?

10:14.200 --> 10:15.360
Money?

10:16.360 --> 10:18.960
Would deities ever need
such mortal things?

10:22.560 --> 10:25.800
If White Asura
was so compassionate and desireless,

10:26.320 --> 10:27.360
why did they leave?

10:28.080 --> 10:30.280
And why did they come back
after two years?

10:31.320 --> 10:34.520
They left out of disappointment.

10:35.600 --> 10:37.160
They came back out of mercy.

10:38.680 --> 10:40.000
With gratitude to you, White Asura.

10:43.400 --> 10:46.280
A white parrot showed you the spot?

10:47.800 --> 10:48.640
Yes.

10:49.840 --> 10:53.920
There is only one white parrot
that flies around the Penglai Pool.

10:54.840 --> 10:55.680
That's right.

10:56.720 --> 10:59.360
It's Lady in Snow, given to Consort Shu

11:01.360 --> 11:02.720
by His Majesty.

11:05.920 --> 11:06.520
TRANQUIL BREEZE, LUMINOUS MOON

11:06.600 --> 11:08.720
Why did you come so early in the morning?

11:08.800 --> 11:10.240
I've been busy till dawn.

11:10.320 --> 11:13.520
I went to sleep
but felt hungry all of a sudden.

11:13.600 --> 11:17.400
And I started craving
a bowl of five-flavor wontons.

11:18.280 --> 11:20.480
Then I just ended up in your palace.

11:23.040 --> 11:25.240
I just hate to see you work so hard.

11:25.320 --> 11:26.560
You're ruining your health.

11:27.280 --> 11:29.880
The five-flavor wontons
you have are the best.

11:29.960 --> 11:32.200
I'll take a bowl to His Majesty.

11:32.280 --> 11:34.880
His Majesty is busy with work.
Don't bother him.

11:36.600 --> 11:38.360
Why are you so shy?

11:38.960 --> 11:40.760
If he doesn't come, just invite him.

11:40.840 --> 11:43.200
Don't let Brilliant Lady Dou
walk all over you.

11:45.600 --> 11:47.800
The fates of the palace people
shift like the tides.

11:47.880 --> 11:49.200
You know this well.

11:50.000 --> 11:52.480
His Majesty's favor ebbs and flows.

11:53.080 --> 11:55.440
When His Majesty used to visit me often,

11:55.520 --> 11:57.160
they were all smiles.

11:57.240 --> 11:58.840
Perhaps it's for the good.

11:59.360 --> 12:02.200
At least now I can glimpse
what is true and what is false.

12:03.800 --> 12:04.800
Aren't you worried?

12:06.680 --> 12:07.840
Why would I be?

12:09.520 --> 12:10.800
Then I'm relieved.

12:11.640 --> 12:14.320
No matter what,
you're the only Consort Shu in the palace.

12:16.360 --> 12:18.480
May you be well, Your Highness.

12:19.880 --> 12:21.640
This little thing startled me.

12:22.480 --> 12:23.840
That was really loud.

12:23.920 --> 12:26.160
Fuqu. Take Lady in Snow out.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.280
Understood.

12:28.200 --> 12:29.080
Wait.

12:32.520 --> 12:33.720
Let me see it.

12:37.800 --> 12:39.240
This parrot is well kept.

12:39.760 --> 12:41.800
Beautiful feathers and a nice voice.

12:43.240 --> 12:44.520
Are you taking care of it?

12:44.600 --> 12:45.320
FUQU PALACE MAID

12:45.400 --> 12:48.040
I'm simply taking it out
for a few hours every day.

12:48.120 --> 12:50.040
Someone else is looking after it.

12:52.280 --> 12:54.120
Where does it usually go?

12:54.640 --> 12:56.320
Sometimes, Yuchun Garden.

12:56.400 --> 12:57.880
Sometimes, Penglai Pool.

12:59.080 --> 13:00.520
How do you make it listen?

13:04.600 --> 13:06.960
Lady in Snow
is His Majesty's gift to Her Highness.

13:07.040 --> 13:08.360
It doesn't listen to me.

13:08.440 --> 13:10.800
I only set it free in the garden

13:10.880 --> 13:12.360
every day.

13:12.440 --> 13:14.320
Wherever it goes, I follow.

13:14.400 --> 13:16.800
When it's tired, it flies back on its own.

13:16.880 --> 13:18.440
And I bring it back.

13:23.000 --> 13:25.560
Your Highness,
I'm taking Lady in Snow out.

13:31.040 --> 13:32.760
That little thing is very clever.

13:33.280 --> 13:34.800
It's quite like a child.

13:35.480 --> 13:36.520
How is it clever?

13:36.600 --> 13:39.160
It only says,
"May you be well, Your Highness."

13:39.240 --> 13:41.280
I was teaching it to greet His Majesty,

13:41.360 --> 13:42.680
but it couldn't learn.

13:44.680 --> 13:47.040
Has Your Highness heard of White Asura?

13:48.320 --> 13:49.160
What is that?

13:51.040 --> 13:53.600
Nothing. I just learned about it.

13:54.720 --> 13:56.040
Your Highness.

13:56.120 --> 13:58.440
I'll go to sleep. See you another time.

13:58.520 --> 13:59.520
Go ahead.

14:05.680 --> 14:08.320
It's been half a month.
I finally got a good night's sleep.

14:08.880 --> 14:09.920
Your Ladyship.

14:10.440 --> 14:11.440
Hungry?

14:18.840 --> 14:19.920
I know you're the best.

14:20.600 --> 14:22.800
You should be hungry.
You slept for eight hours.

14:23.880 --> 14:25.120
Have I slept so long?

14:26.920 --> 14:27.760
Your Ladyship.

14:28.720 --> 14:30.840
Your Ladyship,
Pan Yongqi finally confessed.

14:30.920 --> 14:32.680
By "devout worship,"

14:32.760 --> 14:34.360
they meant performing rites
for White Asura

14:34.440 --> 14:35.800
at a shrine within the palace.

14:36.480 --> 14:38.600
He was so stubborn. How did you break him?

14:39.640 --> 14:40.680
It must have been your idea.

14:41.520 --> 14:42.920
I offered him ginseng seeds.

14:43.440 --> 14:44.560
Let's take a look.

14:44.640 --> 14:46.080
Ginseng seeds?

14:46.600 --> 14:49.080
Your Ladyship,
can you use the evidence like that?

14:50.000 --> 14:50.880
What evidence?

14:51.400 --> 14:53.920
They're not registered.
How are they evidence?

14:59.280 --> 15:00.240
But…

15:00.880 --> 15:02.920
I'm in charge of the registration.

15:37.960 --> 15:40.040
- This way.
- No tricks.

16:01.000 --> 16:01.840
Right here.

16:23.040 --> 16:24.480
White Asura.

16:35.040 --> 16:36.320
White Asura.

16:38.760 --> 16:39.600
White Asura.

16:39.680 --> 16:41.400
- White Asura is here.
- Behave.

16:41.480 --> 16:42.440
Watch him.

16:43.520 --> 16:45.080
White Asura. White Asura.

17:42.000 --> 17:44.000
The Upper Primordial Heavenly Court

17:44.640 --> 17:46.200
manifests its majesty,

17:47.440 --> 17:49.080
where the central gate

17:49.760 --> 17:50.720
is occupied by the upright and impartial.

17:55.840 --> 17:58.280
Someone set a trap
in the bamboo forest to hypnotize you.

17:58.360 --> 18:00.240
That person was likely watching.

18:00.920 --> 18:03.560
To see clearly in the bamboo forest,
you'll need a bird's-eye view.

18:29.200 --> 18:30.120
Your Ladyship.

18:30.720 --> 18:31.880
Why are you here?

18:31.960 --> 18:33.880
I work at the Bureau of Gardens,

18:33.960 --> 18:36.840
responsible for planting.
I had just repotted the flowers.

18:36.920 --> 18:38.920
Why were you standing by the railing?

18:39.000 --> 18:41.800
The sound of bells made me curious.

18:41.880 --> 18:43.040
So I looked around.

18:43.640 --> 18:45.480
You are so intertwined with this case.

18:45.560 --> 18:46.640
I keep running into you.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.160
Your Ladyship.

18:48.240 --> 18:50.960
I have always followed the rules
and never done anything wicked.

18:51.560 --> 18:53.880
The honest ones who turn wicked
are truly troublesome.

18:56.480 --> 18:59.080
What kind of plants
require handling late at night?

18:59.160 --> 19:01.320
These plants have delicate roots.

19:01.400 --> 19:03.000
If repotted in daylight,
they won't survive.

19:03.080 --> 19:04.320
It must be done at night.

19:04.400 --> 19:05.600
Full of tricks.

19:06.720 --> 19:07.880
Your Ladyship, spare me.

19:09.640 --> 19:12.200
I wouldn't find ginseng seeds
in these pots, would I?

19:13.280 --> 19:14.760
Ginseng seeds?

19:14.840 --> 19:16.440
These are just common plants.

19:16.520 --> 19:17.840
Do you know White Asura?

19:18.760 --> 19:19.600
No, Your Ladyship.

19:21.440 --> 19:23.400
Won't you even ask me what that is?

19:32.480 --> 19:35.240
It's late. You'd better
get going, Mr. Xiao.

19:36.400 --> 19:37.680
How long will you avoid me?

19:38.280 --> 19:40.320
- Do you think you can stop me?
- No, I don't.

19:41.040 --> 19:41.880
But I have to.

19:43.720 --> 19:44.720
Alright.

19:44.800 --> 19:47.440
Tell me, Mr. Xiao. What do you want?

19:48.960 --> 19:49.960
I want to apologize.

19:52.800 --> 19:55.760
I withheld the truth
because I was arrogant.

19:56.840 --> 19:59.680
I thought I was protecting you
by keeping those memories from you.

20:01.360 --> 20:03.600
But the truth is, I was weak.

20:04.240 --> 20:06.920
I figured if I couldn't face it,
neither could you,

20:07.000 --> 20:09.880
and if I couldn't take it,
you couldn't either.

20:10.920 --> 20:11.840
But I was wrong.

20:15.240 --> 20:16.640
I have not lived through

20:17.440 --> 20:18.880
your 15 years of pain,

20:19.480 --> 20:22.000
so I have no right to decide for you.

20:22.800 --> 20:23.760
You're a lot braver than I am.

20:23.840 --> 20:25.880
You deserve the truth you want.

20:26.720 --> 20:27.760
You don't need to apologize.

20:28.360 --> 20:29.440
You did nothing wrong.

20:30.760 --> 20:33.200
I forced you to stay by my side
because you could help me

20:33.280 --> 20:34.720
regain my memories.

20:34.800 --> 20:37.400
Now, I remember it all.

20:37.480 --> 20:39.720
- I don't need you anymore.
- But I need you.

20:41.040 --> 20:41.880
At the Lantern Festival Banquet,

20:42.480 --> 20:44.280
you used His Majesty's authority
to keep me by your side.

20:44.360 --> 20:46.920
Someone as smart as you
must have known that I stayed

20:47.000 --> 20:49.080
not just because of that imperial decree.

20:55.040 --> 20:55.880
Peiyi.

20:57.160 --> 20:59.920
I may not have many ways to make you stay.

21:01.240 --> 21:02.720
But I wish to stand by your side.

21:05.800 --> 21:06.680
That's all I know.

21:12.040 --> 21:13.640
Mr. Xiao, stop talking big.

21:14.640 --> 21:16.240
No one stays by anyone's side forever.

21:16.960 --> 21:19.040
My parents and my master

21:19.120 --> 21:20.520
all left me.

21:21.800 --> 21:23.880
No matter how reluctant they were to die,

21:24.920 --> 21:27.360
death would never show mercy.

21:28.960 --> 21:30.920
All these years of investigation work

21:31.800 --> 21:33.120
taught me one thing.

21:34.040 --> 21:36.400
Even if I try my best
and uncover the truth,

21:37.480 --> 21:39.040
it doesn't change anything.

21:41.880 --> 21:43.840
The dead are dead.

21:44.640 --> 21:46.360
The living still suffer.

21:46.960 --> 21:48.640
I advise you to stay away from me.

21:49.520 --> 21:51.360
I'm really a cursed lone star.

21:52.360 --> 21:54.920
Stay by my side and you will die.

21:55.000 --> 21:56.920
- I'm not afraid.
- But I am.

22:00.440 --> 22:02.280
I don't want to lose anyone again.

22:02.960 --> 22:04.080
Do you dare to take a gamble?

22:06.920 --> 22:08.800
On what? Against whom?

22:08.880 --> 22:11.240
Against Heaven. Against fate.

22:14.640 --> 22:15.960
See if I end up dead

22:17.200 --> 22:18.040
by your side.

22:18.120 --> 22:19.200
Are you crazy?

22:19.280 --> 22:21.040
Just think I'm crazy.

22:22.880 --> 22:24.360
I was going crazy

22:25.040 --> 22:26.160
without you.

22:29.200 --> 22:30.280
I've made up my mind.

22:30.800 --> 22:33.600
- This is my business alone.
- No, it's not.

22:36.600 --> 22:39.880
I'm not doing it just because of you.

22:40.760 --> 22:42.440
This is also my nightmare.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.520
I also want to wake up.

22:49.560 --> 22:52.480
It would be best
if I could face it with you.

22:54.000 --> 22:55.240
Even if you turn me down again,

22:57.280 --> 22:58.360
I won't give up.

23:05.560 --> 23:06.520
Alright.

23:07.280 --> 23:08.400
I'll take a gamble.

23:09.160 --> 23:11.600
If you die, I will avenge you.

23:11.680 --> 23:14.000
- If I die--
- I will avenge you,

23:14.960 --> 23:16.080
no matter what.

23:23.800 --> 23:24.680
Let's go find Wuren.

23:31.880 --> 23:32.920
Your Ladyship.

23:34.720 --> 23:36.760
- What happened?
- Pan Yongqi died.

23:44.240 --> 23:45.120
What happened?

23:58.640 --> 23:59.480
White Asura.

24:02.440 --> 24:04.160
White Asura.

24:04.240 --> 24:06.160
- White Asura, don't go.
- Stop fooling yourself.

24:06.760 --> 24:08.560
If White Asura could protect you,
how did you get caught?

24:09.240 --> 24:10.440
Give me another chance.

24:11.400 --> 24:12.720
Give me another chance.

24:13.320 --> 24:14.800
Give me another chance.

24:24.680 --> 24:26.840
I shall return with you, White Asura.

24:28.800 --> 24:29.760
Pan Yongqi.

24:33.880 --> 24:35.400
I shall return with you,

24:36.640 --> 24:38.360
White Asura.

24:44.480 --> 24:46.200
Did you see anyone pass by
with a crossbow?

24:46.280 --> 24:47.440
No.

24:47.520 --> 24:49.120
I didn't see anyone all the way.

24:50.040 --> 24:51.800
Pan Yongqi showed no signs of fear

24:51.880 --> 24:53.560
and didn't even try to dodge the bolt.

24:54.560 --> 24:55.760
I can't tell what it was like.

24:58.160 --> 24:59.000
Pious.

25:00.520 --> 25:02.480
Yeah. He was pious.

25:04.440 --> 25:06.880
This bolt is used by the Imperial Guards.

25:06.960 --> 25:08.480
The maximum range is about ten zhang.

25:09.080 --> 25:10.800
If I trace the trajectory of the bolt,

25:10.880 --> 25:12.280
I might find traces of the killer.

25:14.480 --> 25:16.400
Who knows what lurks in these bamboos?

25:16.480 --> 25:17.320
Don't go alone.

25:19.120 --> 25:20.080
Go with Mr. Xiao.

25:20.160 --> 25:21.160
Alright.

25:25.840 --> 25:26.800
You reconciled?

25:28.560 --> 25:29.920
Stay here. I'll look around.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.080
Understood.

25:34.840 --> 25:36.560
I came from the rockery

25:37.080 --> 25:39.400
and ran into Wuren near here.

25:40.440 --> 25:42.400
Judging from the location of the body

25:42.480 --> 25:44.160
and the angle of the bolt shot,

25:44.240 --> 25:46.520
we can confirm
that the bolt came from here.

25:47.240 --> 25:49.680
The two of you came from two directions,

25:49.760 --> 25:51.800
but neither of you spotted the killer.

26:01.440 --> 26:02.840
Mr. Xiao, stay here.

26:02.920 --> 26:03.920
I'll go.

26:04.760 --> 26:05.680
Be careful.

26:08.920 --> 26:09.840
Found it.

26:12.720 --> 26:15.000
Killed by a bolt. No poisoning.

26:15.080 --> 26:16.280
No other wounds.

26:18.480 --> 26:21.480
Outsiders can't easily obtain the weapons
of Imperial Guards.

26:21.560 --> 26:22.520
An Imperial Guard did it?

26:22.600 --> 26:25.360
But since he wanted to play tricks,

26:25.440 --> 26:26.920
why reveal his identity?

26:32.280 --> 26:33.520
"All hail White Asura"?

26:34.120 --> 26:36.720
He was tied up.
When did he put it in his mouth?

26:38.080 --> 26:40.360
This paper has been waxed
and doesn't get wet.

26:40.440 --> 26:43.000
He probably kept it in his mouth
before going to the altar.

26:43.800 --> 26:45.000
He knew he was going to die?

26:49.240 --> 26:50.760
If I had been more alert,

26:50.840 --> 26:51.920
Pan Yongqi wouldn't have died.

26:52.000 --> 26:54.720
He was determined to die.
You couldn't do much.

27:00.960 --> 27:02.520
These bells…

27:02.600 --> 27:04.200
The killer set up the bells

27:04.280 --> 27:06.960
to hypnotize you the moment you enter
the bamboo forest.

27:07.040 --> 27:09.560
The night in the bamboo forest
was silent and eerie.

27:09.640 --> 27:12.080
Dense stalks and leaves obscured the moon,

27:12.160 --> 27:13.840
leaving you disoriented.

27:13.920 --> 27:17.040
That person lured you with a bell's chime.

27:17.120 --> 27:19.000
When you fixate on abnormal sounds

27:19.080 --> 27:21.120
with heightened tension,

27:21.200 --> 27:23.120
your other senses let down their guard.

27:23.200 --> 27:25.880
In the end, when you reached the altar,

27:25.960 --> 27:28.000
the spinning wind wheels

27:28.080 --> 27:31.320
hypnotized you and rendered you confused.

27:31.400 --> 27:32.560
White Asura.

27:33.600 --> 27:34.600
I remember

27:35.120 --> 27:36.640
that Pan Yongqi
knelt in front of the altar

27:36.720 --> 27:37.880
and shouted, "White Asura."

27:37.960 --> 27:39.240
Then we saw the ghostly figures.

27:40.160 --> 27:41.080
Pan Yongqi set us up?

27:42.520 --> 27:45.200
No. His reaction was the same as ours.

27:45.280 --> 27:46.920
He was more like a pawn.

27:47.000 --> 27:49.280
But his blind worship of White Asura

27:49.360 --> 27:50.960
enhanced the hypnosis.

27:51.040 --> 27:52.280
What he shouted

27:52.360 --> 27:54.240
became the key
to pushing us into the illusion.

27:54.920 --> 27:56.000
These bells

27:56.080 --> 27:57.960
were strung on the bamboo branches

27:58.040 --> 27:59.200
and chimed when the wind blew.

28:00.080 --> 28:01.320
But their tones were sharp and hasty.

28:01.400 --> 28:05.360
Some bells were hung there,
but there was more to it.

28:08.080 --> 28:10.280
There was a weasel caught in a snare.

28:10.880 --> 28:13.560
There were plenty of bells
tied to the bamboo.

28:13.640 --> 28:15.880
The weasel struggled
and jostled the branches,

28:15.960 --> 28:17.880
making the bells clatter in bursts.

28:18.560 --> 28:21.480
I set it free.
And it smoked me with a fart.

28:23.640 --> 28:25.920
How did the weasel get caught by this net?

28:35.160 --> 28:36.600
This is an animal trap.

28:36.680 --> 28:38.600
Put the food in it.

28:38.680 --> 28:39.560
When the weasel

28:39.640 --> 28:41.640
steps on the wire
connecting the mechanism,

28:41.720 --> 28:42.560
it bounces off

28:42.640 --> 28:43.960
and the net closes

28:44.040 --> 28:45.480
to trap the weasel inside.

28:45.560 --> 28:47.880
This is rare to find in the palace.

28:47.960 --> 28:49.560
Lightweight and hidden.

28:49.640 --> 28:51.800
A few leaves can cover it up.

28:52.400 --> 28:54.480
This murderer has a lot of tricks.

28:57.680 --> 28:58.800
Have you found the crossbow?

28:59.400 --> 29:01.840
Yes. But the bolt was the bamboo.

29:05.640 --> 29:06.760
Bing Shen 57.

29:07.360 --> 29:09.600
Pan Yongqi's helmet also bears that code.

29:10.160 --> 29:12.000
He was shot by his own crossbow.

29:14.760 --> 29:16.800
This bamboo is extremely tough

29:16.880 --> 29:19.040
and holds enough power to pull the trigger

29:19.120 --> 29:20.200
and shoot the bolt.

29:27.320 --> 29:29.560
What a perfect spot.

29:29.640 --> 29:31.200
The person knew that this crossbow

29:31.280 --> 29:33.760
had to be steady to hit the target.

29:35.400 --> 29:36.680
Bamboo leaves fall this season

29:36.760 --> 29:39.080
and cover the ground in an instant,

29:39.160 --> 29:40.960
covering the footprints.

29:58.600 --> 29:59.960
Deep at the heel, shallow at the toe.

30:00.040 --> 30:01.720
The pressure rested on the hindfoot.

30:01.800 --> 30:03.720
Proof of retreat.

30:04.960 --> 30:06.400
He was pulling back the bamboo.

30:10.160 --> 30:12.600
The person should be above six chi.

30:12.680 --> 30:13.960
Strongly built.

30:14.720 --> 30:17.400
His left foot bears greater weight

30:18.000 --> 30:20.400
and turns outward,
while his right steps normally.

30:25.840 --> 30:26.760
It was Pan Yongqi.

30:27.960 --> 30:29.600
Pan Yongqi?

30:30.840 --> 30:33.200
He set up the trap to kill himself?

30:35.760 --> 30:38.280
No wonder he looked like
he knew about his doom.

30:38.880 --> 30:40.440
The bamboo is tough.

30:40.520 --> 30:43.320
Attach it to the trigger
and it shoots the bolts powerfully.

30:43.840 --> 30:46.920
So, something must be placed there
to catch the trigger.

30:47.600 --> 30:49.240
Remove it when it's time,

30:49.320 --> 30:51.040
the bamboo bounces back

30:51.120 --> 30:53.200
and pulls the trigger to release the shot.

30:53.280 --> 30:55.080
But we've searched this area.

30:55.160 --> 30:57.320
There was nothing
except for this crossbow.

30:58.040 --> 30:58.920
Ice.

30:59.000 --> 31:00.760
Ice cubes are hard enough
to hold the trigger.

31:00.840 --> 31:02.080
When the ice melts,

31:02.160 --> 31:04.320
the bamboo can pull the trigger.

31:05.040 --> 31:06.600
When Pan Yongqi was shot,

31:06.680 --> 31:07.880
did you hear or see something?

31:12.080 --> 31:13.040
The drum.

31:13.880 --> 31:16.640
Pan Yongqi heard the drums

31:16.720 --> 31:18.200
and rushed to the altar to die.

31:18.280 --> 31:19.800
So it wasn't ice.

31:19.880 --> 31:22.200
It's hard to control how fast ice melts.

31:31.280 --> 31:32.160
It was a pine strip.

31:34.720 --> 31:36.720
A pine strip was set
behind the crossbow trigger.

31:36.800 --> 31:39.720
When it burned to the trigger,
it would drop off,

31:40.400 --> 31:42.560
allowing the bamboo to pull the trigger.

31:42.640 --> 31:45.040
The pine strips used for incense
in the palace are all standardized.

31:45.120 --> 31:47.240
It takes two hours to burn.

31:47.320 --> 31:50.200
Someone timed it
and lit the strip beforehand.

31:50.280 --> 31:53.160
Then the ashes drifted away with the wind,

31:54.120 --> 31:56.160
but the few traces left could prove it.

32:01.240 --> 32:02.480
I shall return with you,

32:04.280 --> 32:05.120
White Asura.

32:06.160 --> 32:07.920
Pan Yongqi was arrested yesterday.

32:08.440 --> 32:10.840
When did he light the pine strip?

32:11.440 --> 32:12.680
Someone else did it.

32:12.760 --> 32:14.640
And this person is extremely cautious.

32:15.240 --> 32:17.720
He scattered
these fallen leaves on purpose

32:18.240 --> 32:19.720
to cover the footprints.

32:20.320 --> 32:22.160
So, Pan Yongqi had a solid plan.

32:22.240 --> 32:23.440
If he hadn't been caught,

32:24.040 --> 32:25.680
he could have completed
everything on his own

32:25.760 --> 32:27.320
and embraced his death at the altar.

32:27.920 --> 32:29.360
But if anything happened,

32:29.440 --> 32:31.280
someone else who knew his plan

32:31.360 --> 32:33.280
would light the pine strip for him.

32:33.880 --> 32:34.840
No wonder.

32:35.640 --> 32:38.040
I gave him the ginseng
seeds at the Wei hour,

32:38.600 --> 32:40.520
but he confessed
halfway into the Shen hour.

32:41.880 --> 32:44.320
He wasn't being tough. He was waiting

32:44.400 --> 32:47.240
for his partner to light the pine strip

32:47.320 --> 32:48.960
so he could go to the altar as planned.

32:49.040 --> 32:51.560
That person helped him commit suicide.

32:52.280 --> 32:55.160
We have to find that person
to get an answer.

32:55.760 --> 32:57.600
We have always been in charge

32:57.680 --> 32:59.200
of the gardening in Xingqing Palace.

32:59.280 --> 33:02.320
Everything you want to know
is recorded here.

33:04.800 --> 33:06.000
Supervised by Fuqu.

33:07.080 --> 33:07.920
It's her again.

33:08.720 --> 33:10.480
The one who takes care of Lady in Snow?

33:11.320 --> 33:12.200
That's right.

33:13.160 --> 33:15.440
Fuqu doesn't talk much.

33:15.520 --> 33:18.520
She's either tending to the plants
or being alone.

33:18.600 --> 33:20.960
She only likes Lady in Snow.

33:22.040 --> 33:25.240
She is tending to the garden.
Why did she go to serve Consort Shu?

33:26.000 --> 33:28.520
They say that Lady in Snow
only listens to her call.

33:28.600 --> 33:31.520
It landed on her the first time it saw her

33:31.600 --> 33:33.080
by the Penglai Pool.

33:33.760 --> 33:35.840
So Consort Shu asked her to take it out

33:35.920 --> 33:37.840
for fun every day.

33:38.360 --> 33:40.080
She likes the bird, too,

33:40.160 --> 33:41.960
and often makes puree for it.

33:42.040 --> 33:44.600
But she doesn't serve Consort Shu.

33:45.200 --> 33:47.880
The palace maid personally sent
by Consort Shu for this job

33:47.960 --> 33:48.800
is called Mingcui.

33:57.360 --> 33:59.120
Heading to see Lady in Snow again?

34:05.240 --> 34:08.000
Refreshing aroma. You made it yourself?

34:08.840 --> 34:10.159
I don't burn incense.

34:12.120 --> 34:14.120
I probably got the smell from the flowers.

34:15.480 --> 34:18.679
It smells good.
I bet Lady in Snow likes it, too.

34:26.880 --> 34:29.000
From the magnolia to the bird,

34:29.080 --> 34:31.360
to the pavilion near the altar,
we keep seeing her.

34:31.440 --> 34:33.480
She's definitely hiding something.

34:33.560 --> 34:34.520
Why don't we arrest her?

34:34.600 --> 34:36.199
We can't anymore.

34:36.280 --> 34:37.480
Why not?

34:38.120 --> 34:39.280
I asked the chief gardener.

34:39.800 --> 34:42.760
Fuqu was taking care of the plants
from the beginning of the Shen hour

34:42.840 --> 34:45.199
until I came to her and never left.

34:46.159 --> 34:49.280
The guards nearby and her fellow workers
can testify for her.

34:52.080 --> 34:53.000
Your Ladyship.

34:53.639 --> 34:54.600
I found something.

34:54.679 --> 34:57.280
The southwestern shamans
use sound and visual tricks

34:57.360 --> 34:59.320
to hypnotize victims
and make them submissive.

34:59.400 --> 35:02.080
And they often set snares
in the thick woods

35:02.160 --> 35:04.680
to trap wild mice for medicine testing.

35:05.200 --> 35:08.840
So this person can roam the palace
undetected at night

35:08.920 --> 35:10.840
and knows the ways of the shamans.

35:10.920 --> 35:12.760
I'll follow this lead.

35:15.360 --> 35:17.800
Mr. Xiao. What should we look into?

35:18.400 --> 35:21.560
One particular item has strict records
of its amount and usage.

35:21.640 --> 35:23.560
Any misappropriation of it
will leave a trace.

35:24.560 --> 35:25.400
Ginseng seeds?

35:28.440 --> 35:29.640
That's all?

35:29.720 --> 35:30.680
No.

35:30.760 --> 35:32.600
These are left outside for emergency use.

35:32.680 --> 35:34.680
Most of them are in high cabinets.

35:38.480 --> 35:39.800
Why are there two locks?

35:40.560 --> 35:42.920
Precious materials
are not accessible to all.

35:43.000 --> 35:46.000
We check the prescriptions from the Aide

35:46.080 --> 35:48.280
to the Imperial Physician
before giving them out.

35:48.360 --> 35:49.800
We hold two keys.

35:49.880 --> 35:53.040
One with me,
the other with Physician Luo Zhian.

35:53.840 --> 35:55.640
But they're so small.

35:55.720 --> 35:57.760
Isn't it hard to detect
even if some are stolen?

35:57.840 --> 35:59.240
No.

35:59.320 --> 36:01.360
There are records
of their dosage and quantity.

36:01.440 --> 36:03.600
Physician Luo checks them every month.

36:03.680 --> 36:05.160
And I double-check afterward.

36:05.960 --> 36:07.680
What if something spoils?

36:07.760 --> 36:09.720
We burn them in bulk.

36:17.280 --> 36:19.480
MEDICINAL MATERIAL USAGE RECORD

36:21.520 --> 36:24.720
Wooden box, pine needles,
dried lotus leaves.

36:25.360 --> 36:26.680
Ginseng seeds fear damp?

36:26.760 --> 36:27.680
That's right.

36:27.760 --> 36:29.840
They may not be easy to spoil,

36:29.920 --> 36:32.760
but they must be stored
in a cool, dry, and ventilated place.

36:33.640 --> 36:35.320
Why is the loss
in the eighth and ninth months

36:35.400 --> 36:36.720
higher than usual?

36:36.800 --> 36:39.200
The Western Capital is rainy and humid
this time of year.

36:39.280 --> 36:41.720
So the loss is higher than usual.

36:42.720 --> 36:43.760
Indeed.

36:43.840 --> 36:45.680
The loss in these two months

36:45.760 --> 36:47.320
was nearly 10% higher
than the rest of the months.

36:47.400 --> 36:48.480
It's the same this year.

36:49.280 --> 36:50.280
Your Ladyship.

36:50.360 --> 36:52.840
Physician Luo won't be back
from the palace any time soon.

36:52.920 --> 36:55.840
We're not allowed
to leave our keys behind.

36:55.920 --> 36:58.640
If Your Ladyship
wants to check the ginseng seeds,

36:59.840 --> 37:02.440
- you may have to wait.
- It's alright.

37:02.520 --> 37:04.040
Do you know

37:04.120 --> 37:06.320
where Physician Luo
resides in the Western Capital?

37:06.400 --> 37:07.280
Take us there.

37:08.440 --> 37:11.120
Physician Luo lives here alone.

37:11.200 --> 37:12.920
His family is in Weizhou, their hometown.

37:13.000 --> 37:14.760
The room faces north.

37:14.840 --> 37:16.080
It's a bit dark.

37:17.200 --> 37:18.640
Physician Luo gets paid well,

37:19.160 --> 37:20.160
but his room is so humble?

37:20.240 --> 37:22.280
He doesn't care about such things.

37:22.360 --> 37:24.440
He's working in the palace
most of the time

37:24.520 --> 37:26.120
and only comes back to sleep.

37:26.200 --> 37:28.800
Besides, he sends
most of his income back home

37:28.880 --> 37:31.040
to support his entire family.

37:37.080 --> 37:38.360
The room is cold and damp.

37:38.440 --> 37:41.000
The clothes smell musty.
Is there no place to air and dry them?

37:41.840 --> 37:42.760
Yes, there is.

37:42.840 --> 37:45.320
There's a patio where we get some sun.

37:52.680 --> 37:54.560
What do you think, Mr. Xiao?

37:55.240 --> 37:58.000
This yard may be dry and airy,

37:58.080 --> 38:00.160
but why didn't you remove the hive?

38:00.240 --> 38:02.600
It's troublesome
if you get stung by a bee.

38:04.000 --> 38:05.840
I haven't seen a bee for a while.

38:17.960 --> 38:19.000
What…

38:23.520 --> 38:26.080
Physician Luo stole these
from his own post!

38:31.080 --> 38:33.200
Spoiled ginseng seeds
have no medicinal use.

38:33.280 --> 38:34.520
They serve nothing.

38:34.600 --> 38:36.680
We would burn them anyway.

38:36.760 --> 38:38.880
You've never played cards, have you?

38:40.400 --> 38:42.880
Then it's natural that you haven't seen
the tricks of cheaters.

38:46.360 --> 38:47.680
How many leaves am I holding?

38:48.800 --> 38:49.880
Five.

38:59.840 --> 39:00.920
What…

39:08.000 --> 39:08.840
I switched them.

39:10.080 --> 39:11.640
That's how Physician Luo

39:11.720 --> 39:13.760
stole fresh ginseng seeds from the stock.

39:15.760 --> 39:17.240
Take us to Physician Luo.

39:21.640 --> 39:22.720
Why didn't we take

39:22.800 --> 39:24.760
the east path to Talent Liu's palace?

39:24.840 --> 39:26.480
We should go from there.

39:27.080 --> 39:28.880
But Physician Luo insists
on taking this Yin-Yang Road

39:28.960 --> 39:30.400
to see Talent Liu these days.

39:30.480 --> 39:33.720
This path may be shorter,
but it's really freaky.

39:33.800 --> 39:34.880
Yin-Yang Road?

39:35.400 --> 39:37.360
It is a winding corridor
connecting the palaces.

39:37.440 --> 39:39.280
But it faces the northwest

39:39.360 --> 39:41.120
and rarely gets sun during the day.

39:41.200 --> 39:43.960
There is no light at night,
which makes it even darker.

39:44.040 --> 39:45.640
Day and night, the sun and the moon

39:45.720 --> 39:47.400
can only illuminate parts of the path.

39:47.480 --> 39:49.960
The eunuchs and palace maids named it

39:50.040 --> 39:51.640
the Yin-Yang Road for fun.

39:51.720 --> 39:52.920
Although it's a shortcut,

39:53.000 --> 39:54.560
people would rather avoid it.

39:55.080 --> 39:56.720
Few people take this path,

39:57.360 --> 39:58.840
which makes it

39:58.920 --> 40:00.440
even more gloomy.

40:01.400 --> 40:02.520
Just around the corner.

40:16.960 --> 40:18.880
Who dropped the lantern?

40:29.840 --> 40:30.680
Look around.

40:34.840 --> 40:36.200
Over there.

